    <mxCell id="box_mobile" value="📱 Mobile Client (Flutter 3.x / Dart 3.x - Android &amp; iOS)
Đối tượng: Sinh viên FPTU (85%+ Traffic) &amp; CTV Soát vé Cổng" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#3B82F6;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1E3A8A;rounded=1;startSize=26;arcSize=4;" parent="box_client" vertex="1"   >
      <mxGeometry x="20" y="40" width="530" height="170" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="m_screens" value="UI Screens:
• HomeScreen (Banner, Featured, Categories)
• ExploreScreen (46 CLB FPTU, Search Accent-free)
• EventDetailScreen &amp; RegistrationModal
• DigitalTicketScreen (Dynamic QR Token, Anti-fraud)
• CalendarScreen (Lưới tháng &amp; ngày động now())
• LiveCompanionScreen (Agenda, Live Q&amp;A, Upvote)
• MobileDeskScreen (Bàn soát vé cổng Camera 1.5s)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#93C5FD;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1E293B;" parent="box_mobile" vertex="1"   >
      <mxGeometry x="15" y="35" width="245" height="120" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="m_viewmodels" value="MVVM State Management (Provider):
• AuthViewModel (Google SSO &amp; FPT Mail)
• HomeViewModel &amp; ExploreViewModel
• EventDetailViewModel (BR-001..004)
• RegistrationViewModel (Slide 18 Cross-Role)
• MyTicketsViewModel (Active, Attended, Cancel)
• LiveEventViewModel (Realtime Firestore stream)
• MobileDeskViewModel (Quét mã vé 1.5s)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#93C5FD;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1E293B;" parent="box_mobile" vertex="1"   >
      <mxGeometry x="270" y="35" width="245" height="120" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="box_web" value="💻 Web Admin Portal (Desktop Responsive CMS - HTML5/CSS3/Vanilla JS)
Đối tượng: Cán bộ Phòng CTSV &amp; Ban Chủ Nhiệm CLB" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF7ED;strokeColor=#F97316;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7C2D12;rounded=1;startSize=26;arcSize=4;" parent="box_client" vertex="1"   >
      <mxGeometry x="570" y="40" width="530" height="170" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="w_modules" value="9 Phân Hệ Nghiệp Vụ Chuyên Sâu (View-Sections):
1. Tổng quan &amp; Dashboard KPI Đồng bộ Firestore
2. Hàng Chờ Duyệt Vé (Cross-Role Review Queue Slide 18)
3. Thẩm định &amp; Phê duyệt Dự toán Ngân sách CLB
4. Hồ sơ An toàn PCCC &amp; Sức chứa Hội trường Trịnh Công Sơn
5. Danh bạ Sinh viên &amp; Xuất Chứng nhận e-Certificate
6. Phát sóng Thông báo Khẩn (Announcements Broadcast)
7. Giám sát Viễn trắc Cổng Check-In (Gate Telemetry Live)
8. Lịch Trực Ban Soát Vé Cổng (Duty Roster)
9. Quản lý Địa điểm &amp; Tạo Sự Kiện Mới" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#FDBA74;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#1E293B;" parent="box_web" vertex="1"   >
      <mxGeometry x="15" y="35" width="330" height="120" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="w_backend" value="Native Web Bridge Server:
• Zero-dependency Node.js HTTP
• Cloud Firestore REST API Bridge
• Bearer Token Auto-refresh
• Memory &amp; Disk Quota Cache
• Port: 3000 (Local daemon)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#FDBA74;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#1E293B;" parent="box_web" vertex="1"   >
